1
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:21,920
Hello, Jiajia.

2
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:22,920
Is that you?

3
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:25,120
She's not here.

4
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,120
Who are you?

5
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:29,960
I'm her friend.

6
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:32,320
You're not her friend.

7
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,679
You're Gao Shuqing.

8
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:38,759
You're Sun Hui.

9
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,359
What do you want with Jiajia?

10
00:00:43,439 --> 00:00:45,079
You just said Jiajia went out.

11
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,520
Right.

12
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:48,840
No.

13
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,520
She's still at your place.

14
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,719
Why would I lie to you?

15
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,759
If she went out,

16
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:55,960
then who's at your place?

17
00:00:58,759 --> 00:00:59,520
How did you...

18
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:03,759
Are there cameras only in the nursery?

19
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,040
They're all over the house.

20
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:09,719
That's perfect.

21
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:11,680
Hand me your phone.

22
00:01:11,959 --> 00:01:13,680
I'll give you the camera access password.

23
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,640
Jiang Jia shared camera access with you.

24
00:01:22,719 --> 00:01:23,519
You're very smart.

25
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:26,480
So you saw everything.

26
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,439
More than that.

27
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,719
I even screen-recorded it.

28
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,719
Honestly, I was really shocked.

29
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,920
You look quite gentle,

30
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:37,319
but you're surprisingly ruthless.

31
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,000
Did you call the police?

32
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,480
How could I?

33
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,120
If I did that,

34
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,840
it's over for both of us.

35
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:54,000
So what was your original plan?

36
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,680
I heard Lu Yuan say

37
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,959
a new nanny was coming this afternoon.

38
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,200
So you had Jiang Jia impersonate her,

39
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,680
to steal your baby,

40
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:05,120
and then extort you.

41
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,840
How did you know the nanny would be late?

42
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,800
Because I texted the nanny,

43
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,879
telling her to leave later.

44
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,199
Posing as the agency, of course.

45
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,719
When Lu Yuan contacted her,

46
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:22,919
I was quite nervous.

47
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,800
Luckily, that nanny was smart enough

48
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,719
not to argue with Lu Yuan.

49
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,280
You're committing a crime.

50
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,520
So what?

51
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,520
We both owe a huge debt.

52
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:35,199
If we can't pay it back,

53
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,199
we're dead.

54
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,800
Can you stop rushing me?

55
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,759
I won't regret this.

56
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:49,680
I...

57
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:54,039
I have my own reasons.

58
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,360
But Jiang Jia didn't do what you said.

59
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,000
That's right.

60
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:02,639
At one point, I thought the plan had failed.

61
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,319
When she fell,

62
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,439
you didn't know she was dead.

63
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,240
I just thought she passed out.

64
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,759
Then why didn't you save her?

65
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,520
Why should I save her?

66
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:18,360
It's extortion either way.

67
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:22,159
Whether it's your baby or her life,

68
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,759
there's no difference.

69
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,479
You're a real bastard.

70
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:27,840
And you're any better?

71
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:29,479
You're a murderer.

72
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,199
Who's worse?

73
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,800
What exactly do you want?

74
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,319
It's simple.

75
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,319
I want money.

76
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,479
Lu Yuan is here.

77
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,680
Add me on WeChat to talk.

78
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:52,919
Hello?

79
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:54,759
Hello?

80
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:58,639
Calm down, we'll think of something.

81
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,400
I can't let Lu Yuan know about this.

82
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,840
You said

83
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,040
running away won't solve the problem.

84
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,319
Besides this,

85
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,000
there's no other way.

86
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,040
Lu Yuan will find out sooner or later

87
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,199
about what you've done.

88
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,920
You know him.

89
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:35,879
He won't hurt you,

90
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,720
but he can't face you either.

91
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,439
What should I do?

92
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,639
No matter what you do,

93
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:45,560
it won't make things better.

94
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,600
Your existence

95
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,199
has become chaos itself.

96
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,839
I don't want this either.

97
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,240
It's not about what you want.

98
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,240
You didn't want to kill me either,

99
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:01,000
but look at the result.

100
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,879
I am the problem itself.

101
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:13,240
This is the reality you're running from.

102
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,759
You only make everyone suffer.

103
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,800
Whether it's Lu Yuan,

104
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:25,000
Xiao Ran,

105
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,040
or yourself.

106
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,480
No.

107
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,040
There's no dog here.

108
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,160
It's all Xiao Ran's hallucination.

109
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,560
I might really be crazy,

110
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,319
but I'm not stupid.

111
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,240
He'll be back soon.

112
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,079
We have ten minutes at most.

113
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,240
That's enough.

114
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,560
These gold bars are worth

115
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,000
two million more than you asked for.

116
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,639
I'll keep my word

117
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,839
and keep your secret safe.

118
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:56,560
Wait.

119
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,879
This isn't over yet.

120
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,839
Help me take her away.

121
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,120
Take her where?

122
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,720
He's a liar.

123
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,399
I have no idea what's going on.

124
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,120
I fell down the stairs

125
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:27,360
and hit my head.

126
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,040
Where is Gao Shuqing?

127
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,759
What the hell is going on?

128
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:32,600
What did you say?

129
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,800
No wonder Lu Yuan said you have issues.

130
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,680
What did Lu Yuan say?

131
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,839
Who has issues?

132
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,240
You.

133
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,879
You, Gao Shuqing.

134
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,920
What did you say?

135
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,000
I'm Jiang Jia.

136
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,959
Jiang Jia is dead.

137
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:50,920
You told me so yourself.

138
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,439
What the hell are you talking about?

139
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,439
She's alive and well.

140
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,399
Isn't Jiang Jia in here?

141
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:02,639
Is she?

142
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,680
Isn't Jiang Jia in there?

143
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,439
She's inside.

144
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,680
Did you see it with your own eyes?

145
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,120
See for yourself.

146
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:34,960
Sun Hui.

147
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,799
It's finally over.

148
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,000
Daddy's back!

149
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:58,600
Mommy, Daddy's home.

150
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,919
Mommy, Daddy's home.

151
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:10,559
I'm home.

152
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,000
Ranran, where's Mommy?

153
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,039
Where is Mommy?

154
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:21,639
Mr. Lu.

155
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:23,840
Should I put these in the living room,

156
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,759
or on the second floor?

157
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:26,720
Daddy bought you

158
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,600
so many toys today.

159
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,279
Here.

160
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:37,840
Look at how many things Daddy got you.

161
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,399
They're all yours.

162
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:40,120
Come on, go take a look.

163
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:42,360
Daddy bought me so many toys!

164
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,759
Mommy, come out quick!

165
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,279
You're home, Honey.

166
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:47,759
I'm back.

167
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,519
Are you tired?

168
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,200
Not at all.

169
00:09:49,879 --> 00:09:50,519
You put on makeup.

170
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,000
Yeah.

171
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,000
It's been so long, I'm a bit rusty.

172
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,200
How is it? Do I look good?

173
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,519
You look beautiful with or without it.

174
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,600
Here, Ranran, come here.

175
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,799
Have the bird's nest soup Mommy made.

176
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,799
Hello, I'm Jiang Jia.

177
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,320
You're so beautiful.

178
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,159
So young, too.

179
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:16,639
Young? I'm in my forties.

180
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,120
Now I know

181
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:21,120
why Lu Yuan likes you.

182
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:22,799
Why?

183
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:24,559
Because you're more mature.

184
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,399
And more grounded.

185
00:10:26,879 --> 00:10:28,559
We both go after what we want,

186
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,480
stopping at nothing.

187
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,519
But you hide it better.

188
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,679
You really think Lu Yuan would like you?

189
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,879
A forty-year-old woman?

190
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:37,240
And what makes you think

191
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,759
he'd like who you are now?

192
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,519
An irritable, short-tempered,

193
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:44,080
incompetent mother and wife?

194
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,360
Hello, I'm Lu Yuan's wife.

195
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:24,080
I already said no.

196
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,759
Who are you talking to?

197
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:29,519
Get a new diaper.

198
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,000
Okay, where is it?

199
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,240
No need. Let her get it.

200
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,000
She knows where it is.

201
00:11:47,759 --> 00:11:49,000
What do you want to do now?

202
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,039
That depends on

203
00:11:51,159 --> 00:11:52,519
why you're here.

204
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,000
What do you think?

205
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,000
You want to replace me.

206
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:10,519
Congratulations to Ms. Jiang Jia

207
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,559
for her superb performance,

208
00:14:12,639 --> 00:14:14,919
winning the 25th

209
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:17,840
Golden Muse Award for Best Actress!

210
00:14:19,039 --> 00:14:22,279
"Flower's Eclipse" is a very special film.

211
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,360
We know that to perfectly portray

212
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,879
the role of Gao Shuqing,

213
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,960
you've put in so much effort.

214
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:30,080
Standing here right now,

215
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:33,679
who do you want to thank the most?

216
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,720
The person I want to thank the most is...
